# Chapter 2 — The First Click

*That accidental click.*

No big prompt. No perfect question.

I didn't know about prompt engineering back then.

No techniques. No frameworks.

To me, it was just another website with a text box.

So I simply typed:

> **"Can you get me the daily data for 2330?"**

It wasn't a project.

It wasn't even an experiment.

Just a small test.

If it worked, great.

If not, I would close the window and go back to copying numbers by hand.

I had no expectation that this conversation would continue.

I clicked **Send**.

**I had no idea that one click would become thousands of conversations.**
